   "title": "LIG D&A CEO denies company's involvement in bribery allegations",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/law-crime/20261026/lig-da-ceo-denies-companys-involvement-in-bribery-allegations",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
