   "_dt": 1793014622.0,
   "ageDays": 0.01,
   "summary": "Korean President Lee Jae Myung on Monday congratulated Brazilian President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva on his reelection for a fourth term. \"I congratulate you on your victory with greater pleasure than anyone,\" Lee wrote on his X account, hours after Lula won Sunday's presidential election runoff to secure a fourth nonconsecutive term.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国总统李在明星期一祝贺巴西总统卢伊兹·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦赢得第四个任期。李在自己的X账号上写道：“我怀着比任何人都更大的喜悦祝贺你取得这场胜利。”此前数小时，卢拉在星期日的总统选举决选中获胜，确保获得第四个非连续任期。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Korean President Lee Jae Myung on Monday congratulated Brazilian President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva on his reelection for a fourth term. \"I congratulate you on your victory with greater pleasure than anyone,\" Lee wrote on his X account, hours after Lula won Sunday's presidential election runoff to secure a fourth nonconsecutive term. Lee called Lula \"a special friend and comrade.\" Lee and Lula have met in person on several occasions, forging a special personal bond through their shared experience of working as child laborers",
