   "title": "Davido’s aide offers cash reward for stolen phone at Zlatan Ibile’s wedding",
   "url": "https://punchng.com/davidos-aide-offers-cash-reward-for-stolen-phone-at-zlatan-ibiles-wedding/",
   "domain": "punchng.com",
